# Flycast and console: !NetTime against the real pool.ntp.org with UTC -8 (the Mac's
# zone, PST), then *Time. No VMU file, so the server is the default.
# Flycast: tools/replay2c.py tests/nettime-hw.replay -36, with HW_REPLAY=1.
